# These paths can reach production, sign-in, or the agents of whoever reviews a change, so GitHub
# asks the people listed here to look at a change to them. Their approval isn't required: like
# anything else, it needs a person to merge it once CI has passed.
/.claude/        @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/.devcontainer/  @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/.github/        @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/AGENTS.md       @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/CLAUDE.md       @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/Cargo.lock      @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/Cargo.toml      @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/deploy/         @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/hooks/          @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/src/auth.rs     @CakeRepository @morganparadis
/src/passkey.rs  @CakeRepository @morganparadis
